flowchart TD
    SUB[ESME submit_sm] --> ROUTE[Route lookup — MySQL smpp_route]
    ROUTE --> CREDIT{Deduct credit? — smpp_user}
    CREDIT --> MODE{database-store-primary?}

    MODE -->|yes| ACK1[ACK immediately]
    ACK1 --> ADD1[add_message]
    ADD1 --> STORE[(smpp_store)]

    MODE -->|no| BBADD[bearerbox_add_message]
    BBADD --> BBON{Bearerbox online?}
    BBON -->|yes| SMSC[Forward to SMSC]
    BBON -->|no| ENQ{database-enable-queue?}
    ENQ -->|yes| ADDQ[add_queue_message]
    ADDQ --> QSTORE[(smpp_store_queue)]
    ENQ -->|no| REJECT[Reject RSYSERR]

    EXT[External pickup store-primary] -->|LPOP or SELECT| STORE
